        {
          "page": 2,
          "text_chars": 612,
          "text_preview": "Learning objective 1, Key words: magical, weapon, amazed, attack, fell asleep,   grab,  2,   Key   sentences:  This is a perfect weapon for me.  Nobody will ever attack us again. I’m going to live for",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 3,
          "text_chars": 317,
          "text_preview": "                             Do you know what are the weapons? What are  wrapons  for?   Warm up Tips:1,   Look   at the pictures and ask the S if he/she knows about the weapons? 2, Ask S to introduce",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 4,
          "text_chars": 18,
          "text_preview": "Video Time(0-1:43)",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 5,
          "text_chars": 277,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1, what can you see in the picture?                    2,what  colour  is the iron bar? 3, Did  Wukong  lift the iron bar ? Is the iron bar huge, big or small?                       ",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 6,
          "text_chars": 301,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1, Where did  Wukong  placed the iron bar? 2, How did the Dragon Queen feel about  Wukong ? 3, Is the King  happy,angry  or sad ?  (He felt very angry)           4, Did  Wukong  like",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 7,
          "text_chars": 383,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1,  What did  Wukong  do after he goes back home?(He shows the new weapon to the others) 2,  How did the subjects feel about the weapon?(They are amazed by  Wukong’s  new weapon) 3, ",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 8,
          "text_chars": 21,
          "text_preview": "Video Time(1:44-3:05)",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 9,
          "text_chars": 306,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1, What can you see in the picture?    2, How many spirits grabbed  Wukong ?               3, What did  Wukong  do when the spirits dragged him out of his cave?(The second picture) 4",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 10,
          "text_chars": 415,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1, Where were they in the pictures?      2, What is the Palace of Darkness?(That’s where people go when people die) 3, How did  Wukong  feel when he knows he is in the Palace of Dark",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
