          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 12,
          "text_chars": 357,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1, Who is the man talking with  Wukong ?  (He is the Judge of the dead)    2, Is the man an old man or a young man? 3, Why did  Wukong  causing all the troubles?(He wants to know why",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
